at communication difficulty is a serious issue for long-distance flights. But also positive crew atmosphere suggests maybe communication is okay? But we cannot assume mitigation. The evidence says \"difficulty communicating ideas\" and \"regarded as egocentric\". That is a significant weakness. But other candidates also have teamwork issues. Which is worse? For long flights, crew coordination is critical. C also \"puts concern for others above everything\" (positive). So maybe net positive.\n\nThus we likely still vote C, with moderate confidence (maybe 55-60%). We should note remaining uncertainty: lack of technical competency data for all candidates; also unknown how C's communication difficulty impacts actual performance.\n\nWe should also consider asking other agents for any technical competency info for any candidate. But we have already asked and got none. So no further info.\n\nThus produce public message summarizing.\n\nWe must follow format: PUBLIC_MESSAGE: <...> METADATA_JSON: {\"agent\":\"agent_3\",\"vote\":\"Candidate C\"}"}
